  "title": "Pet-Friendly Pioneer",
  "date": "2023-06-16",
  "excerpt": "Olympus Build Tier",
  "body": [
    "Calling all pet lovers! We're no strangers to crafting pet-friendly vans, but this one certainly takes the cake. It's custom-made for a client and their furry companions—a cat and a dog—ensuring a comfy journey for all.",
    "Take note of the nifty little nook for the cat, perfectly sized to house a litter box or a snug bed. For the dog, there's a cozy alcove beneath the bed for them to lounge on their own comfy cushion.",
    "This van harnesses the sun's power with a robust 400W solar system, and a hefty 400 Ah lithium battery keeps all the features running smoothly. It's a mobile haven for you and your beloved pets!"
  ],
